          "content": {
            "size": 838,
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A Walk Through Spring\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A photo essay about a neighborhood garden.\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/synthetic-cover/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\"></head><body><h1 id=\"activity-name\">A Walk Through Spring</h1><span id=\"js_name\">Example Account</span><span id=\"publish_time\">2026-04-18</span><div id=\"js_content\"><section><p>The garden reopened after the rain.</p><p><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/synthetic-first/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"853\"></p><p>New leaves appeared along the path.</p><section><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/synthetic-second/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"960\" data-height=\"540\"></section><p>Visitors returned before sunset.</p></section></div></body></html>"
